{"4732790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cyber Buglets", "steam_appid": 4732790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after its shutdown, a beloved early-2000s online world flickers back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The servers shouldn’t be running. The players are long gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yet… something is still here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber Buglets is a single-player point-and-click deduction puzzler set inside an abandoned virtual pets MMO. Log back into a world frozen in its final moments and learn what happens to happy memories left to decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forgotten spaces, sift through old chat logs, and follow trails of strange activity left behind by whoever - or whatever - rebooted the servers. Discover cracks in the system and slip out-of-bounds using uncovered account IDs and admin tools to progress deeper and learn the fate of the original game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the deeper you go, the less this feels like a simple glitch in the software.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is trying to relive the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it doesn’t want to be erased.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after its shutdown, a beloved early-2000s online world flickers back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The servers shouldn’t be running. The players are long gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yet… something is still here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber Buglets is a single-player point-and-click deduction puzzler set inside an abandoned virtual pets MMO. Log back into a world frozen in its final moments and learn what happens to happy memories left to decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forgotten spaces, sift through old chat logs, and follow trails of strange activity left behind by whoever - or whatever - rebooted the servers. Discover cracks in 